.TH elfshaker-esi-add 1  "elfshaker 1.0.0-rc1" "elfshaker Manual"
.SH NAME
elfshaker\-esi\-add \- Adds packs to one or more ESI indexes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBelfshaker esi add\fR [OPTIONS] <ESI_FILE> <PACK>...
.SH DESCRIPTION
Adds packs to one or more ESI indexes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-force\fR
Replace an entry with the same stored URL.
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-backup\fR
Do not replace <ESI_FILE>.bak with the previous contents.
.TP
\fB\-\-also\fR \fI<ESI_FILE>\fR
Apply the operation to another ESI file; may be repeated.
.TP
\fB\-\-pack\-url\fR \fI<PACK_URL>\fR
Stored URL for a single pack; defaults to its filename.
.TP
\fB\-\-verbose\fR
Show informational progress and diagnostic messages.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIESI_FILE\fR>
Primary ESI file to edit.
.TP
<\fIPACK\fR>...
Pack files to add, in output order.
